  "exposed_text": "\nextends Node\nexport(Resource) var thing # A_Thing\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint('first frame')\n\tprint(is_instance_valid(thing))\n\tprint(thing.g1())\n\tprint(thing.g2())\n\tprint(thing.g3())\n\tyield(get_tree(), 'idle_frame')\n\n\tprint('second frame')\n\tthing.s1(0)\n\tthing.s2(0)\n\tthing.s3('0')\n\tprint(thing.g1())\n\tprint(thing.g2())\n\tprint(thing.g2())\n\tyield(get_tree(), 'idle_frame')\n\n\tprint('third frame')\n\tif get_global('stop'):\n\t\tbreakpoint\n\t\treturn\n\tset_global('stop', true)\n\tget_tree().root.add_child(Node.new())\n\tget_tree().change_scene(get_tree().current_scene.filename)\n\nfunc set_global(n, v): get_tree().set_meta(n, v)\nfunc get_global(s): if get_tree().has_meta(s): return get_tree().get_meta(s)\n",
